{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ravengrave 1: Iron Bonds - Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the world of blacksmithing and manage your own workshop in this early glimpse of the full game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What's included in this demo:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Two game modes</strong> \u2013 Play a <strong>story fragment</strong> or take on commissions in <strong>Free mode</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Basic forging</strong> \u2013 Work with <strong>metal smelting</strong>, the first step in the blacksmithing process.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Free mode</strong> \u2013 Complete up to <strong>six commissions</strong> before running out of available orders. You can still play and practice, but without further deliveries.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Basic resource management</strong> \u2013 Purchase materials and handle your finances with debt limited to your spending.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With detailed pixel art and gameplay that is both accessible and challenging, Ravengrave 1: Iron Bonds offers an immersive experience of forging and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo is just a preview of what <strong>Ravengrave 1: Iron Bonds</strong> will offer, including the <strong>full story, advanced forging mechanics, and the challenge of repaying a massive debt</strong>. <strong>Add it to your wishlist and share your feedback to help me improve the game!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546580?t=1745173275","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546580?t=1745173275","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546580/ac8b03fcd7f3d684b99a10e404a1fd69f21269fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745173275","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstat